WEBVTT

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:23.899
Stars glitfer in the breaking dawn sky

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:28.695
After journeying from light years away

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:34.368
Man predicts our fate and destiny

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:37.454
But the ulfimafte destination

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:42.876
Is known only through blood, sweat, and fears

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.880
Stargazer! Turn! Turn! Earth!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.800
This life that was born here

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.555
Live sfrong and liberare LIGHT

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:58.559
A strong bond connects our hearts

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.562
You and | who baftle side by side

00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:04.231
The dancing flames of dawn

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:07.234
The beat that resounds fo efernity

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:10.070
The harmony of our feelings

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.781
Are flaring up... Ah

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:16.910
Awakening that fingling POWER

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:21.498
Shine on Destination!

00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:35.012
Uncho Kan'u of 1800 years ago...

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:41.268
| will return your despicable
curse, here and now!

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:45.814
Heaven and Earth... White Wave Shock!

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:19.640
Thank you, Chou'un. | could hear your voice

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:25.687
even through the efforts of the warrior
spirits of the past to trick me...

00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:35.072
Thank you, Ryomou.

00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:39.701
Your strength as a fighter liberated
you from the spell of a bitter grudge

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:42.412
and saved your soul.

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:48.502
Kan'y, let's go back to Seito.

00:02:48.502 --> 00:02:53.340
Our leader needs your strength.

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:07.020
Saji... Ryofu...

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:20.242
In your condition, you wouldn't
be able fo put up much of a fight...

00:03:23.078 --> 00:03:26.081
| sense a fear that comes
from exhausting your chi.

00:03:26.081 --> 00:03:27.749
You bastard!

00:03:27.749 --> 00:03:34.589
| will personally settle the battle of destiny
between Uncho Kan'v and Shimei Ryomou.

00:03:34.589 --> 00:03:38.385
You will be the sacrifice that
christens the mobilization of my army.

00:03:39.386 --> 00:03:42.347
So that's Kentei...

00:03:56.611 --> 00:04:00.907
Shimei Ryomou... Why are you here?

00:04:02.492 --> 00:04:04.661
1800 years ago...

00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:07.664
Hakufu Sonsaku, the Sho-Haou of Jiangdong,

00:04:07.664 --> 00:04:10.792
took a poison arrow to the eye during an attack

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:13.837
and left this life on Earth
at the tender age of 26.

00:04:20.594 --> 00:04:23.805
Why did Kyocho help Hakufu?

00:04:25.849 --> 00:04:27.768
Shuyu.

00:04:27.768 --> 00:04:30.103
Koukin.

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:35.108
During the Battle of Red Cliffs,
he led the Wu army to victory

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:38.987
with a strategy that even fooled his allies.

00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:41.656
| wish we had someone like you at Kyosho.

00:04:41.656 --> 00:04:46.995
A right-hand man with a genius
for helping his Emperor.

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:51.166
You don't mean... Moutoku Sousou?!

00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:56.296
Much too much blood was spilt 1800 years ago.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:05:01.218
The chain of negafive karma confinues
to this day via the sacred beads.

00:05:01.218 --> 00:05:04.971
If this continues, the oufcome...

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:08.809
..can only be oblivion.

00:05:08.809 --> 00:05:10.644
No...

00:05:13.021 --> 00:05:16.983
But you may be right.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:23.490
We are, after all, nothing more than
pawns to bring back the Three Kingdoms.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:30.664
However, there is one person who can sever
the negative karma of the sacred beads.

00:05:30.664 --> 00:05:32.374
That person is...

00:05:35.168 --> 00:05:39.881
Hakufu... can change our destiny?

00:06:01.695 --> 00:06:03.280
Hey Kentel...

00:06:07.909 --> 00:06:12.747
You had some nerve to trick
us like that into fighting.

00:06:12.747 --> 00:06:17.752
Even if you are the true emperor,

00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:21.047
|, Kan'v, won't ever forgive you!

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:26.052
Fool. You're powerless now.

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:29.055
You may be the reincarnation
of an ancient warrior,

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:32.726
but once you exceed your physical
limits, all that remains is death.

00:06:34.603 --> 00:06:38.315
By then you won't be alive, either.

00:06:38.315 --> 00:06:45.280
Her injuries are severe, she's lost a lot of
blood, and her chi is depleted, and yet...

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:50.785
Uncho Kan'u... what dauntlessness.

00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:54.080
She is a true god of military arts.

00:07:20.941 --> 00:07:23.109
What're you doing?

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:28.281
If you just stand there,

00:07:28.281 --> 00:07:30.492
you'l get killed!

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:49.719
Kan'
ul

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:54.224
Are you all right?!

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:18.498
Come on out!

00:08:19.874 --> 00:08:23.712
Fighters don't run and hide.

00:08:36.766 --> 00:08:38.226
Why...

00:08:38.226 --> 00:08:40.562
Why are you trying to kill us?

00:08:40.562 --> 00:08:44.691
You're being controlled
by that hooded monster!

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.570
Snap out of it!

00:09:08.131 --> 00:09:11.051
Give me your hand. Quickly!

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:12.052
Why?

00:09:12.052 --> 00:09:13.470
Now!

00:09:16.056 --> 00:09:17.724
I-u

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:25.190
| can't hold on!

00:09:44.459 --> 00:09:46.628
You're...

00:09:46.628 --> 00:09:49.506
..Chuutatsu Shibali!

00:10:01.935 --> 00:10:06.981
Damn... You really fought hard, dammit.

00:10:13.321 --> 00:10:14.823
Big Sis...

00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:19.953
What's the matter with you?
What took you so long?

00:10:19.953 --> 00:10:22.997
We were wrong...

00:10:22.997 --> 00:10:25.625
..about what it means to be a fighter...

00:10:27.836 --> 00:10:30.672
| know, dummy.

00:10:30.672 --> 00:10:34.509
What we needed wasn't some crummy strategy...

00:10:34.509 --> 00:10:37.303
We needed strong enemies!

00:10:38.972 --> 00:10:40.515
Right!

00:10:40.515 --> 00:10:44.811
Makes me feel good fo
find people worth beating!

00:10:44.811 --> 00:10:47.730
Don't you guys agree? Idiots!

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.732
Yeah!

00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:57.031
The body of Shibai, whom you killed
in the Battle of Red Cliffs, is gone.

00:10:57.031 --> 00:10:58.408
Did you say Shibai?

00:10:58.408 --> 00:11:05.165
His soul, however, had nowhere to go,
and wandered about in hell, calling out...

00:11:05.165 --> 00:11:06.875
What're you talking about?

00:11:06.875 --> 00:11:10.545
The power of those who answered his call..

00:11:14.048 --> 00:11:17.677
..came fogether as one fo create this body!

00:11:19.679 --> 00:11:22.390
| will kill every single one of you fighters...

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:26.686
| am the new ruler who brings
destruction and chaos to the present world.

00:11:30.106 --> 00:11:32.901
| am the Kentei, emperor of the Later Han!

00:11:35.028 --> 00:11:41.075
Sousou said Hakufu could change our destiny...

00:11:41.075 --> 00:11:43.912
But does she really possess the power?

00:11:43.912 --> 00:11:45.747
She does.

00:11:45.747 --> 00:11:48.917
During the Battle of Red Cliffs...

00:11:48.917 --> 00:11:52.295
If the dragon swallowed Mou-Aun,

00:11:52.295 --> 00:11:57.300
| was going to kill him
myself and take my own life...

00:11:58.426 --> 00:12:04.140
But Sonsaku saved Mou-4unwhen
the Devil King possessed him.

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.976
Sonsaku did that back then?

00:12:06.976 --> 00:12:08.728
That's right..

00:12:08.728 --> 00:12:12.607
Sousou would sacrifice anything for hegemony.

00:12:12.607 --> 00:12:17.820
Conversely, Ryuubi would choose
death in order to help a friend.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.782
But Sonsaku would do neither.

00:12:20.782 --> 00:12:25.161
She was benevolent foward
both vassals and enemies.

00:12:25.161 --> 00:12:28.164
A truly ideal ruler.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.753
W-What are you doing?

00:12:33.753 --> 00:12:37.840
I'm going to fight Kentei with this!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:42.762
I've heard that ancient malice and ill will
are sealed inside this Hyakuhekitou.

00:12:43.846 --> 00:12:47.308
Even Kentei could not
fend off this magical blade...

00:13:01.698 --> 00:13:03.324
What were you thinking?!

00:13:03.324 --> 00:13:09.372
Unless you have the power of Sho Haou,
the sword's evil will overpower you.

00:13:09.372 --> 00:13:11.291
| don't carel

00:13:11.291 --> 00:13:15.712
Even if it costs me my life,

00:13:15.712 --> 00:13:20.717
| have to do something for Hakufu!

00:13:44.699 --> 00:13:45.908
Koukin...

00:13:59.172 --> 00:14:00.757
This is...

00:14:01.883 --> 00:14:03.343
Hakufu...

00:14:14.896 --> 00:14:16.939
The Water Dragon's chi...

00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:31.037
Another enemy?

00:14:31.037 --> 00:14:32.121
No...

00:14:36.584 --> 00:14:38.044
Sonsaku...

00:14:45.593 --> 00:14:48.971
The Sho-Haou of the Koutou...

00:14:48.971 --> 00:14:55.937
To the fighters, you are like a poison,
a wrench in the cogs of destiny.

00:14:55.937 --> 00:14:58.439
| cannot let you live...

00:14:59.941 --> 00:15:03.569
| don't know who the heck you are, but...

00:15:03.569 --> 00:15:06.781
But | do know that you're a stupid
fool who won't come to his senses

00:15:06.781 --> 00:15:08.991
unless you get your butt kicked!

00:15:08.991 --> 00:15:13.746
Oops, | said "stupid™ | forgot...
the one who says stupid is the stupid one.

00:15:15.289 --> 00:15:16.290
Die!

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.918
The battle begins now!

00:15:20.253 --> 00:15:22.171
Good grief...

00:15:22.171 --> 00:15:29.470
She's always jumping info things
without thinking... such a problem child.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:37.103
History is changing greatly. Your daughter
is at the center of the maelstrom.

00:15:37.103 --> 00:15:43.943
She's inherited the wishes of her father...

00:15:43.943 --> 00:15:45.611
It was about two years ago...

00:15:45.611 --> 00:15:49.824
A lone fighter visited the
sacred stone in the mounfains.

00:15:49.824 --> 00:15:56.122
But even the man people said was
"loyal in peace, a traitor in chaos"

00:15:56.122 --> 00:16:01.461
had his stricken soul saved by Hakufu Sonsaku.

00:16:06.507 --> 00:16:11.053
You must hate me, Ukitsu...

00:16:11.053 --> 00:16:17.018
| knew that this would happen.
You must think I'm a terrible master.

00:16:17.018 --> 00:16:22.732
Throughout history, hegemony has
been built upon sacrifices of all kinds.

00:16:22.732 --> 00:16:30.990
But even now, your soul continues
to battle together with that fool...

00:16:38.164 --> 00:16:42.210
What suddenly brought Mother Goei here?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.213
Could something have happened to Big Sister?

00:16:45.213 --> 00:16:48.424
Big Sister Hakufu has grown stronger again...

00:16:48.424 --> 00:16:49.550
Huh?

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:52.845
What do you mean, Genpo?

00:16:52.845 --> 00:16:55.932
Her dragon is dancing in the sky.

00:16:57.517 --> 00:17:04.482
Big Sister's dragon watches
over us from high in the sky.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:09.320
You bastard!

00:17:10.112 --> 00:17:13.908
This sort of looks like Sonsaku.

00:17:13.908 --> 00:17:17.036
They say pets resemble their masters.

00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:21.249
By the way, is Kyosho protected?

00:17:21.249 --> 00:17:24.085
No problem. Our guys can handle it.

00:17:24.085 --> 00:17:27.213
I'm more worried about
Nanyo without its leader.

00:17:27.213 --> 00:17:32.260
Yeah, but she doesn't act like a leader...

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:37.139
She has these mysterious...
or should | say crazy... powers.

00:17:37.139 --> 00:17:42.270
You never know... she might be
the type that makes history.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.438
Don't you think so, too?

00:18:14.093 --> 00:18:16.929
G-Gentoku!

00:18:16.929 --> 00:18:20.016
Maa-chan... help me...

00:18:24.812 --> 00:18:25.938
What was I?

00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:29.317
You were unconscious.

00:18:29.317 --> 00:18:32.862
You exhausted all of your powers.
That was to be expected.

00:18:35.448 --> 00:18:38.367
That girl... is she all right?

00:18:41.287 --> 00:18:44.206
Oh no! What about Master?!

00:18:44.206 --> 00:18:50.796
That Hyakuhekitou once stopped evil, but
| didn't expect it to destroy my armor...

00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:56.218
With the power of the Haou's dragon,
it has become a frightening magical sword.

00:18:56.218 --> 00:18:59.305
What're you waiting for? Finish me off.

00:18:59.305 --> 00:19:02.725
Relish the taste of victory.

00:19:02.725 --> 00:19:08.022
You want my blood... It's how you fighters
who live with killing enjoy victory.

00:19:13.402 --> 00:19:14.695
Sonsaku?

00:19:14.695 --> 00:19:19.367
Why didn't you kill him?
He used vile tricks to entrap us

00:19:19.367 --> 00:19:21.410
and tried fo destroy us.

00:19:25.373 --> 00:19:28.084
| am a fighter,

00:19:28.084 --> 00:19:32.338
but | don't fight with the intention of killing.

00:19:32.338 --> 00:19:35.216
Destiny and the sacred beads are a part of me...

00:19:35.216 --> 00:19:38.219
But | will settle my battles my way!

00:19:39.345 --> 00:19:42.723
Because | am mel!

00:19:42.723 --> 00:19:46.727
You'll regret those words.

00:19:55.528 --> 00:19:57.780
What have you done?

00:20:00.616 --> 00:20:04.954
My followers... My children!

00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:11.919
Your ambitions end here! Go quietly
to hell, never to be seen again!

00:20:11.919 --> 00:20:17.341
The bulbs of life that you intended to
bring back to the living will all be burned.

00:20:18.968 --> 00:20:22.471
Kentei... Chuutatsu Shiba!

00:20:23.764 --> 00:20:26.225
Koumei Shokatsuryou...

00:20:27.309 --> 00:20:31.021
You've stood in the way
of hegemony once again.

00:20:35.651 --> 00:20:37.486
So be it.

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.909
You people have won.

00:20:43.909 --> 00:20:49.290
But be prepared...
There will be no future for fighters.

00:20:51.459 --> 00:20:58.132
You cannot escape the destiny that
lies in the glow of the sacred beads.

00:20:59.341 --> 00:21:00.926
- Your destruction is something
you will summon unto yourselves...

00:21:00.926 --> 00:21:03.095
- Whose voice is that?
- Your destruction is something you will summon unto yourselves...

00:21:03.095 --> 00:21:04.847
- Kentei's.
- Your destruction is something you will summon unto yourselves...

00:21:04.847 --> 00:21:06.766
- What's he mean?
- Your destruction is something you will summon unto yourselves...

00:21:06.766 --> 00:21:08.476
Who knows?

00:21:09.977 --> 00:21:16.776
| will continue to be reincarnated
unfil the last fighter is gone.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:19.653
Over and over...

00:21:24.325 --> 00:21:26.035
..and over...

00:21:29.038 --> 00:21:31.290
..and over again.

